{"version":1,"key":"card:694","content":{"id":694,"content":[{"children":[{"text":"考虑这样一个场景：你依赖了 A，而 A 依赖了 B。突然 B 被发现存在 bug 或者安全隐患，需要升级。但是 B 不是你直接依赖的，你只能等待 A 的维护者发布新版，这其中的等待时间完全不可控。所以如果能有一种方式直接修改 B 的版本就好了。","type":"formatted"}],"collabId":"c79808b8-b67b-4ab3-bd42-82919a309fcd","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","type":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"code":true,"text":"pnpm.overrides","type":"formatted"},{"text":" 就可以来解决这个问题，它可以用来直接指定依赖的版本号。","type":"formatted"}],"collabId":"3d38e8fd-00fc-488e-8aec-88b9584d8119","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","type":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"code":true,"text":"pnpm.overrides","type":"formatted"},{"text":" 可以写在 ","type":"formatted"},{"code":true,"text":"package.json","type":"formatted"},{"text":" 中，也可以写在 ","type":"formatted"},{"code":true,"text":"pnpm-workspace.yaml","type":"formatted"},{"text":" 中。当写在 ","type":"formatted"},{"code":true,"text":"pnpm-workspace.yaml","type":"formatted"},{"text":" 时，会对 monorepo 中的所有 workspace 生效，基本语法如下：","type":"formatted"}],"collabId":"4641828a-9785-43e8-95aa-f4fba1b3ea3d","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","type":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"children":[{"text":"","type":"formatted"}],"code":"{\n  \"pnpm\": {\n    \"overrides\": {\n      \"包名\": \"版本号\"\n    }\n  }\n}","collabId":"6df4ac3a-a387-41d1-a7c5-0d39b3a288a2","tauContract":"01b01a08366ee00321331f9860d994321d69c2da591e07b067eb5459c9edf05d","type":"code-step"}],"collabId":"5685cfa2-dafc-4e1c-a144-23b6a25002b6","language":"JSON","tauContract":"44e7818805504c164294bff3c403ed0ffed41befee37e5daeb6121e40071bbd6","type":"code-block","uuid":"a7267b94-224e-4a09-af8d-d08fe7831162"},{"children":[{"text":"以下是常见用法：","type":"formatted"}],"collabId":"9d2eba53-9101-4fa2-829c-1030709d21b5","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","type":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"children":[{"children":[{"text":"​覆盖所有版本","type":"formatted"}],"collabId":"1edb0156-f9fd-471d-b573-f9098083f7d2","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","type":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"children":[{"text":"","type":"formatted"}],"code":"{\n  \"pnpm\": {\n    \"overrides\": {\n      \"lodash\": \"4.17.21\"\n    }\n  }\n}","collabId":"d4dd6ca2-9d99-40c5-ad88-3a1554759153","tauContract":"01b01a08366ee00321331f9860d994321d69c2da591e07b067eb5459c9edf05d","type":"code-step"}],"collabId":"60adf7c3-c0d0-49d4-9703-f327a17a9e35","language":"JSON","tauContract":"44e7818805504c164294bff3c403ed0ffed41befee37e5daeb6121e40071bbd6","type":"code-block","uuid":"89444515-34a4-411d-9b02-77a0ca780164"},{"children":[{"text":"key 直接写包名 ","type":"formatted"},{"code":true,"text":"lodash","type":"formatted"},{"text":"，表示替换所有依赖树中的 ","type":"formatted"},{"code":true,"text":"lodash","type":"formatted"},{"text":"。","type":"formatted"},{"code":true,"text":"value","type":"formatted"},{"text":" 写精确版本号 ","type":"formatted"},{"code":true,"text":"4.17.21","type":"formatted"},{"text":"，所有地方的 ","type":"formatted"},{"code":true,"text":"lodash","type":"formatted"},{"text":" 都会被统一替换为这个版本，适用于统一依赖池中的某个包。","type":"formatted"}],"collabId":"76e8ab1e-8f94-413f-8eea-2a10104470c5","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","type":"paragraph"}],"collabId":"970577bc-2f48-46d2-afab-f44d9873151a","tauContract":"fe3a1fc1f6dcf1c1c317754db368a19bd85cab343431da98cae17d783eaa1c02","type":"list-item"},{"children":[{"children":[{"text":"​覆盖指定依赖","type":"formatted"}],"collabId":"8058b9bd-8d7a-4763-9f1d-12ce54662529","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","type":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"children":[{"text":"","type":"formatted"}],"code":"{\n  \"pnpm\": {\n    \"overrides\": {\n      \"foo>bar\": \"2.0.0\"\n    }\n  }\n}","collabId":"8ed9e8d2-e1ad-45d1-adb8-9aa626deddc9","tauContract":"01b01a08366ee00321331f9860d994321d69c2da591e07b067eb5459c9edf05d","type":"code-step"}],"collabId":"f500cb6a-3903-42cf-aac7-4a41e5e4ee69","language":"JSON","tauContract":"44e7818805504c164294bff3c403ed0ffed41befee37e5daeb6121e40071bbd6","type":"code-block","uuid":"99ff14f0-fb9e-4488-8e0b-f954e40b9343"},{"children":[{"text":"使用 ","type":"formatted"},{"code":true,"text":">","type":"formatted"},{"text":" 符号指定嵌套依赖，","type":"formatted"},{"code":true,"text":"foo>bar","type":"formatted"},{"text":" 表示 ","type":"formatted"},{"code":true,"text":"foo","type":"formatted"},{"text":" 依赖的 ","type":"formatted"},{"code":true,"text":"bar","type":"formatted"},{"text":"。这样只会替换 ","type":"formatted"},{"code":true,"text":"foo","type":"formatted"},{"text":" 依赖下的 ","type":"formatted"},{"code":true,"text":"bar","type":"formatted"},{"text":"，其他地方的 ","type":"formatted"},{"code":true,"text":"bar","type":"formatted"},{"text":" 不受影响。支持的嵌套层级不限，例如覆盖 ","type":"formatted"},{"code":true,"text":"foo → bar → baz","type":"formatted"},{"text":" 这条依赖链中的 ","type":"formatted"},{"code":true,"text":"baz","type":"formatted"},{"text":" 可以这样写：","type":"formatted"}],"collabId":"13784d1a-a2d4-4c8c-89ee-01a1f6734d5c","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","type":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"children":[{"text":"","type":"formatted"}],"code":"{\n  \"pnpm\": {\n    \"overrides\": {\n      \"foo>bar>baz\": \"1.0.0\"\n    }\n  }\n}","collabId":"1be56a63-35c3-413b-a53d-7b1109a96931","tauContract":"01b01a08366ee00321331f9860d994321d69c2da591e07b067eb5459c9edf05d","type":"code-step"}],"collabId":"2b4ef25f-1a67-4424-beaa-d2759250ce5a","language":"JSON","tauContract":"44e7818805504c164294bff3c403ed0ffed41befee37e5daeb6121e40071bbd6","type":"code-block","uuid":"af3c138d-b12f-4da5-a2ff-6433dcb91fbf"}],"collabId":"fcf15263-ca77-4b78-b0a3-02b0942e482f","tauContract":"fe3a1f